  "answer_text": "Here is the login information for **PreLicenseTraining.com**:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd10 PreLicenseTraining.com Login\n\n**PreLicenseTraining.com** offers insurance pre-license training and continuing education courses online for insurance professionals.\n\nYou can access the login page directly here:\n\n\ud83d\udc49 **[PreLicenseTraining.com Login](https://prelicensetraining.com/login)**\n\n---\n\n### Other Login Options:\n\n| Portal | Link |\n|---|---|\n| \ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf93 **Student Login** | [prelicensetraining.com/login](https://prelicensetraining.com/login) |\n| \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udcbc **Mentor / Recruiter Login** | [prelicensetraining.com/ca/mentor/register](https://prelicensetraining.com/ca/mentor/register) |\n| \ud83d\udcd8 **PSI Learning Academy Login** | [psionline.prelicensetraining.com](https://psionline.prelicensetraining.com/register) |\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Tips:\n- If you **don't have an account**, you can register at [prelicensetraining.com/register](https://prelicensetraining.com/register).\n- If you've **forgotten your password**, look for the \"Forgot Password\" option on the login page.\n- Make sure you are using the **correct portal** (Student vs. Mentor/Recruiter).\n\nLet me know if you need any further help! \ud83d\ude0a",
